msgid "Event source, route, sink, startup ordering and stop responsibility"
msgstr "事件源、路线、目标动作、启动顺序与停止责任"

msgid ""
"Existing Timer-to-ADC-to-DMA routes are projected as facts; a new graph edge"
" is not a new trigger provider"
msgstr "仅将既有 Timer→ADC→DMA 路线投影为事实；新增图边不代表新增触发 provider"

msgid ""
"[DMA topology](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/dma_topology.py)"
msgstr ""
"[DMA 拓扑](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/dma_topology.py)"

msgid ""
"Separate execution lanes from requests; validate descriptor spans, memory, "
"Cache and security facts"
msgstr "区分执行 lane 与请求来源；检查描述符跨度、内存、Cache 与安全事实"

msgid ""
"Validating a descriptor chain does not implement linked-list DMA execution"
msgstr "描述符链校验不等于实现链表 DMA 执行"

msgid ""
"[I2C timing](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/i2c_timing.py)"
msgstr ""
"[I2C 时序](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/i2c_timing.py)"

msgid "Check explicit clock and electrical bounds using exact arithmetic"
msgstr "用精确算术检查显式时钟与电气边界"

msgid ""
"The calculated unstretched-master rate is not measured bus speed or an "
"allowance for unsupported filter settings"
msgstr "计算得到的非拉伸主机速率不是实测总线速度，也不允许使用尚未支持的滤波设置"

msgid ""
"Startup dependencies must form a directed acyclic graph. A runtime event "
"chain may contain an explicitly autonomous cycle, but its declared stop "
"owner must own the whole cyclic component and its stopping action must cut "
"every cycle. This is a configuration proof about supplied facts, not proof "
"that silicon has stopped. IRQ, DMA, bus and request drain still follow their"
" provider contracts."
msgstr ""
"启动依赖必须是有向无环图。运行事件链可以包含显式声明的自主循环，但指定的停止所有者必须拥有整个循环分量，其停止动作必须切断每一条循环。这是关于输入事实的配置证明，不是硅片已经停止的证明。IRQ、DMA、总线和请求排空仍遵循各自"
" provider 合同。"

msgid ""
"Do not infer that two timer channels can share a controller merely because "
"their pin assignments differ. Common base frequency, update events, trigger "
"outputs, break inputs, reset and clock ownership can still conflict. "
"Likewise, two typed interfaces for one physical IP do not create two "
"independent peripherals."
msgstr ""
"不能仅因引脚分配不同就推断两个 timer channel 可以共享控制器。公共基频、update event、触发输出、break "
"输入、复位和时钟所有权仍可能冲突。同一物理 IP 的两个 typed 接口也不会变成两个独立外设。"

msgid "Bind declared stream budgets to the actual pool"
msgstr "将声明的流预算绑定到实际缓冲池"

msgid ""
"An optional [stream profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/stream_profile.h) binds immutable "
"capacity assumptions to one selected continuous UART or ADC face. The "
"[resolver](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/stream_profiles.py) generates this constant only when"
" the assembly authors a profile. Factory lookup returns that existing "
"profile; it neither creates a pool nor starts acquisition. Unprofiled entry "
"points retain their own contracts and do not implicitly enforce this "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"可选的[流 profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/stream_profile.h)将不可变的容量假设绑定到一个已选连续 UART 或 ADC "
"face。[解析器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/stream_profiles.py)仅在装配显式编写 profile 时生成该常量。factory "
"查找返回已有 profile，既不创建缓冲池，也不启动采集。未使用 profile 的入口保持各自合同，不会隐式执行这一 profile 的约束。"

msgid ""
"The current F407/F470 double-buffer modes require two hardware targets, one "
"replacement and enough additional blocks for the declared FIFO-frontier "
"release delay. The calculation rounds retained blocks up and checks integer "
"overflow, the 32-bit address extent and the 16-bit DMA counter. Target-"
"replacement latency must be strictly shorter than a block's declared fill "
"time. UART units are bytes; ADC units are complete scans containing one "
"`uint16_t` per selected channel. ADC resolution bits do not change this "
"storage width."
msgstr ""
"当前 F407/F470 双缓冲模式需要两个硬件目标、一个替换块，以及足以覆盖所声明 FIFO "
"前沿归还延迟的额外块。计算将保留块数向上取整，并检查整数溢出、32 位地址范围和 16 位 DMA "
"计数器。目标替换延迟必须严格短于声明的单块填满时间。UART 的单位是字节；ADC 的单位是完整扫描，每个所选通道存储一个 `uint16_t`。ADC"
" 分辨率位数不会改变这个存储宽度。"

msgid ""
"Cold profile admission checks the caller's actual block count, equal "
"capacities, existing loans, state and payload/control disjointness before "
"invoking the original provider. Pool users must already be joined. Alias "
"checking is bounded by the configured pool and is quadratic; it adds no "
"checks to the IRQ or steady data path. The application still owns pool "
"storage, consumer release order and execution progress. Rate, release delay "
"and IRQ latency are authored assumptions, with `physical_qualified = false`."
" Exhaustion stops and reports a gap. It does not create UART backpressure, "
"lossless transport or preservation of ADC samples that would have occurred "
"while the trigger was stopped."
msgstr ""
"profile 的冷准入在调用原 provider 前检查调用方的实际块数、相同容量、已有借用、状态以及 payload "
"与控制元数据不重叠。缓冲池使用者必须已经退出并完成 join。别名检查由已配置池大小限定，复杂度为二次方；它不向 IRQ "
"或稳定数据路径增加检查。应用仍负责池存储、consumer 归还顺序和执行推进。速率、归还延迟和 IRQ 延迟都是 authored 假设，标记为 "
"`physical_qualified = false`。耗尽时停止并报告间隙，不会建立 UART 背压、无损传输，也不会保存在触发停止期间本来应发生的"
" ADC 采样。"

msgid "Optional traits report selected behavior"
msgstr "可选 traits 描述选定行为"

msgid ""
"The existing `factory.capabilities` switch controls generated read-only "
"trait objects. [Selected I/O traits](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/io_traits.py) "
"describe a reviewed provider and mode, including formats, limits, abort "
"scope, continuity, timestamp origin and DMA policy. Turning the switch off "
"emits no new trait objects. It does not change the two-pointer base face or "
"add mutable device state."
msgstr ""
"已有 `factory.capabilities` 开关控制生成只读 trait 对象。[选定 I/O "
"traits](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/io_traits.py)描述已审 provider "
"与模式，包括格式、限制、取消范围、连续性、时间戳来源与 DMA 策略。关闭开关不生成新增 trait 对象，不改变双指针 base "
"face，也不增加可变设备状态。"

msgid ""
"A continuity value such as `double_buffer` or `rearm_gap` describes a "
"mechanism, not demonstrated throughput. A Cache line requirement describes "
"the selected provider policy, not proof that a particular clock profile "
"enabled Cache. CAN mailbox counts are provider-specific facts. Traits grant "
"neither Board wiring authorization nor physical qualification and cannot "
"override admission checks."
msgstr ""
"`double_buffer` 或 `rearm_gap` 等连续性值描述机制，不代表已经验证吞吐。Cache 行要求描述选定 provider "
"的策略，不证明某个时钟 profile 已启用 Cache。CAN 邮箱数是 provider 专属事实。Traits 不授予 Board "
"接线权限或物理资格，也不能覆盖准入检查。"

msgid ""
"Controller and endpoint records describe their own interfaces. Do not apply "
"a parent controller's byte-SPI or ordinary-I2C limits to an enhanced "
"endpoint. A per-request word-width marker does not mean unlimited length. "
"Check the selected face, count units and provider limit before allocating "
"caller storage."
msgstr ""
"Controller 和 endpoint 记录分别描述各自接口。不能把父控制器的 byte-SPI 或普通 I2C 限制套到增强 "
"endpoint。按请求确定 word 宽度的标记不代表长度无限。分配调用者存储前，先核对选定 face、计数单位和 provider 限制。"

msgid "Cold silicon admission is an explicit step"
msgstr "冷态硅片准入是显式步骤"

msgid ""
"[Silicon preflight](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/silicon.h) reads one explicit, "
"bounded source in caller-serialized cold Thread context. It copies device-"
"group, revision and Flash-density observations and compares an immutable "
"policy. It does not discover devices, enable clocks, change option bytes or "
"retain a loan. The default platform does not invoke this optional helper "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"[硅片 preflight](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/core/include/nexus/core/silicon.h)在调用者串行化的冷态 Thread "
"上下文中读取一次显式、有界的来源，复制 device group、revision 与 Flash "
"容量观测并比较不可变策略。它不探测设备、不启用时钟、不改 option bytes，也不保留借用。默认平台不会自动调用这个可选 helper。"

msgid ""
"A device group and Flash density cannot prove an exact orderable part, "
"package or PCB. Revision rules bind a reviewed source digest and required "
"workaround mask; the helper does not authenticate that source or prove a "
"workaround was implemented. Unknown revisions require rejection or an "
"explicit unreviewed policy. That policy cannot bypass a blocked revision, "
"missing observation, device or density mismatch, or missing required "
"workaround."
msgstr ""
"Device group 与 Flash 容量不能证明完整可订购物料号、封装或 PCB。Revision 规则绑定已审来源摘要和必需的 "
"workaround mask；helper 不认证来源，也不证明 workaround 已经实现。未知 revision 必须拒绝或采用显式 "
"unreviewed 策略。该策略不能绕过被阻止的 revision、缺失的观测、设备或容量不匹配，以及缺少必需 workaround 的情况。"

msgid ""
"The caller decides whether to start hardware after admission. Reading a "
"revision does not establish electrical behavior, errata coverage for every "
"mode or HIL."
msgstr "准入后仍由调用者决定是否启动硬件。读取 revision 不建立电气行为、全部模式的 errata 覆盖或 HIL 资格。"

msgid "Use units that match the selected data path"
msgstr "计数单位必须匹配选定数据通路"

msgid ""
"The enhanced contracts are separate typed interfaces. Their existence does "
"not change the limits of the ordinary byte interfaces or enable a mode in "
"every provider. Current generated selection and execution status remain in "
"the ledger."
msgstr ""
"增强合同使用独立 typed 接口。接口存在不改变普通 byte 接口的限制，也不会在每个 provider "
"中启用一种模式。当前生成选择与执行状态仍由台账记录。"

msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "机制"

msgid "Units and ownership"
msgstr "单位与所有权"

msgid "Current boundary"
msgstr "当前边界"

