"format is a cold operation"
msgstr "Provider 和已审 Board 路线必须允许该组合；格式变更属于冷态操作"

msgid ""
"[UART words](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart_word.h)"
msgstr ""
"[UART word](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/uart_word.h)"

msgid ""
"Each `uint16_t` carries a nine-bit value; counts and transferred prefixes "
"are words"
msgstr "每个 `uint16_t` 保存一个九位值；数量和已传输前缀均按 word 计数"

msgid ""
"Independent Native, STM32F407 and GD32F470 IRQ paths; DMA and other "
"providers do not inherit this interface"
msgstr "Native、STM32F407 与 GD32F470 的独立 IRQ 路径；DMA 和其他 provider 不自动继承此接口"

msgid ""
"[SPI whole-CS transaction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_transaction.h)"
msgstr ""
"[SPI 全程保持 CS 的事务](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_transaction.h)"

msgid ""
"Up to 16 segments, one common 8/16-bit word width, complete-word prefix"
msgstr "最多 16 个 segment、全事务统一 8/16 位 word 宽度、完整 word 前缀"

msgid ""
"Synchronous polling extension with explicit provider limits; existing byte-"
"span and finite DMA contracts remain separate"
msgstr "同步 polling 扩展，各 provider 限制仍显式生效；既有 byte-span 与有限 DMA 合同保持独立"

msgid ""
"[Segmented SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_dma_transaction.h)"
msgstr ""
"[分段 SPI DMA](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/spi_dma_transaction.h)"

msgid ""
"Words; explicit TX/RX addresses and caller-owned fixed cells; one width "
"across at most 16 segments"
msgstr "单位为 word；TX/RX 地址和调用者所有的 fixed cell 显式提供；最多 16 段共用一个宽度"

msgid ""
"Independent asynchronous request contract; provider integration and software"
" verification remain specific to the selected mode"
msgstr "独立异步请求合同；provider 接入与软件验证仍按选定模式分别建立"

msgid ""
"[Long I2C messages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/i2c_long.h)"
msgstr ""
"[I2C 长消息](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/i2c_long.h)"

msgid "Bytes; one START per message; a later message causes repeated START"
msgstr "单位为 byte；每条 message 一次 START，后续 message 才产生 repeated START"

msgid ""
"Enhanced messages allow up to 65,535 bytes; ordinary messages retain their "
"existing limit and require no additional face"
msgstr "增强 message 最多 65,535 bytes；普通 message 保留原限制，无需新增 face"

msgid ""
"[ADC integer format](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/adc_format.h)"
msgstr ""
"[ADC 整数格式](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/adc_format.h)"

msgid "Explicit signedness, byte order, storage width, padding and scan order"
msgstr "显式描述符号、字节序、存储宽度、padding 和 scan 顺序"

msgid ""
"Layout validation and decoding do not add injected conversion, wider "
"acquisition or synchronized ADC hardware"
msgstr "布局校验与解码不会新增 injected 转换、更宽采集或同步 ADC 硬件"

msgid ""
"[PWM group](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pwm_group.h)"
msgstr ""
"[PWM 组](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/pwm_group.h)"

msgid "A complete fixed-base duty/trigger batch in declared timer ticks"
msgstr "固定基频下完整的 duty/trigger 批次，单位为明确声明的 timer tick"

msgid ""
"A coherent staged batch is not an observed update; generated selection, "
"analog wiring and ADC synchronization are separate exits"
msgstr "一致地暂存一个批次不等于已经观察到 update；生成选择、模拟接线和 ADC 同步是独立退出条件"

msgid ""
"UART word requests retain the ordinary ACCEPTED-to-SETTLED borrowing rule. A"
" cancel or deadline never returns the request or payload early. The owner "
"keeps servicing wire completion and drain; failure to prove drain retains "
"QUARANTINED storage. Byte UART buffers and state do not become nine-bit "
"buffers implicitly."
msgstr ""
"UART word 请求保持从 ACCEPTED 到 SETTLED 的原有借用规则。取消或 deadline 不会提前归还请求或 "
"payload。所有者必须继续 service，推进线上完成与排空；不能证明排空时保留 QUARANTINED 存储。Byte UART "
"缓冲区和状态不会隐式变成九位缓冲区。"

msgid ""
"F407 and F470 RX-only DMA modes now use a compact receive owner with "
"ordinary IRQ TX. Only a duplex DMA mode embeds the separate TX-DMA "
"extension. Both reuse the same receive loan algorithm and shared read-only "
"public operations layout; there is no stored optional implementation pointer"
" or runtime TX-provider selection. RX-only operation does not acquire or "
"withdraw the unrelated TX-DMA lane. Duplex vectors decode their real outer "
"owner and its separate components. The receive pool excludes the complete "
"duplex object, including its extension."
msgstr ""
"F407 和 F470 的仅 RX DMA 模式现在使用紧凑的接收所有者，并保留普通 IRQ TX。只有双向 DMA 模式嵌入独立的 TX-DMA "
"扩展。两者复用相同的接收借用算法和共享只读公共方法表布局，不保存可选实现指针，也不在运行时选择 TX provider。仅 RX "
"操作不会取得或撤回无关的 TX-DMA 执行通道。双向模式的向量按真实外层所有者及其独立部件解码。接收池排除完整双向对象，包括它的扩展。"

msgid ""
"RX and TX admission exclude both the TX payload and the complete TX request "
"descriptor from every future RX target, in both admission orders. Stopping "
"first closes admission and drains RX producer and consumer loans, then "
"drains selected TX memory and wire activity, and finally withdraws the UART "
"and RX vector. Failed drain retains the corresponding storage and "
"responsibility. Actual linked ELF comparisons determine Flash and RAM "
"savings; host `sizeof` expectations alone do not establish MCU costs or an "
"unchanged instruction path."
msgstr ""
"RX 与 TX 两种准入顺序都会从每个未来 RX 目标中排除 TX payload 和完整 TX 请求描述符。停止先关闭准入并排空 RX "
"producer 与 consumer 借用，再排空所选 TX 内存及线上活动，最后撤回 UART 和 RX "
"向量。排空失败保留相应存储和责任。Flash 与 RAM 节省由实际链接 ELF 对比确定；仅主机 `sizeof` 预期不能建立 MCU "
"成本或指令路径未变化的结论。"

msgid ""
"The synchronous whole-CS interface validates every segment and data span "
"before hardware use. A null TX pointer means repeated dummy words, a null RX"
" pointer means discard, and both may be null for clock-only phases. All "
"segments share one asserted CS interval. Polling return releases the "
"synchronous borrow only after CS is released and either wire drain or "
"provider reset is proven; timeout cannot preempt an in-flight word. An error"
" never replays earlier command phases. The asynchronous segmented interface "
"has a separate admission, descriptor and cancellation contract."
msgstr ""
"同步整段 CS 接口在使用硬件前验证每个 segment 和数据范围。TX 指针为空表示重复 dummy 字，RX "
"指针为空表示丢弃，两者都为空可以表示仅产生时钟的阶段。所有 segment 共享一次 CS 有效区间。只有在 CS 已释放，并且已确认（线上排空或 "
"provider 已复位）后，轮询返回才结束同步借用；超时不能抢占正在传输的字。错误不会重放之前的命令阶段。异步分段接口有独立的准入、描述符和取消合同。"

msgid ""
"The STM32F407/GD32F470 segmented DMA mechanism is a service-driven finite "
"chain. Hardware DMA moves one segment, then the owner proves its drain "
"before service arms the next. CS stays asserted across segments, but SCK "
"gaps are permitted; this is not hardware linked-list DMA or a gapless "
"transfer guarantee. The request, all descriptors, all spans and explicit "
"fixed dummy/discard cells stay borrowed until acquire-observed SETTLED. "
"Intermediate completion, cancel and timeout do not release them. Caller-"
"driven service remains necessary; wake attachment and recovery capabilities "
"cannot be inferred from the base SPI port."
msgstr ""
"STM32F407/GD32F470 分段 DMA 机制是由 service 推进的有限链。硬件 DMA 搬运一段后，所有者先证明该段排空，再由 "
"service 装入下一段。跨段保持 CS，但允许 SCK 间隙；这不是硬件链表 DMA，也不保证无间隙传输。请求、全部描述符、全部跨度及显式 "
"fixed dummy/discard cell 持续借用，直到 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。中间段完成、取消和 timeout "
"都不释放这些存储。调用者仍须推动 service，不能从 base SPI port 推断附加唤醒或恢复能力。"

msgid ""
"The optional [segmented SPI owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/spi_dma_owner.h) adapts"
" this enhanced face to the existing bounded BusOwner queue. Caller-supplied "
"slots and epochs remain the queue authority; no worker, payload copy or "
"second controller owner is added. One uniquely scheduled executor services "
"the inner request. Only after acquire-observed inner SETTLED does it detach "
"private descriptor references and allow outer settlement. Queue time counts "
"toward the outer deadline. Failed drain retains inner and outer borrows; "
"late cancellation cannot replace an earlier terminal result."
msgstr ""
"可选的[分段 SPI owner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/spi_dma_owner.h)将该增强 "
"face 接入既有有界 BusOwner 队列。调用方提供的 slot 和 epoch 仍是队列权威，不增加 worker、payload "
"复制或第二个控制器所有者。一个独立调度的唯一执行器推进内部请求。只有 acquire 观察内部 SETTLED "
"后，它才移除私有描述符引用并允许外部请求结束。排队时间计入外部 deadline。排空失败保留内外借用，晚到的取消不能替换更早的终态结果。"

msgid ""
"An owner binding must prove that the endpoint's actual provider controller "
"matches the selected enhanced controller. Matching a common sequence table "
"and logical parent pointer alone is insufficient. The Native word model "
"supplies an independent backend and checks its actual model-controller "
"identity; it models 8/16-bit words, fixed cells, selected CS, faults and "
"retained drain rather than forwarding to a byte-SPI implementation. A "
"model's controller identity is a software identity, not observed silicon. "
"Family hooks, generated owner bindings, publisher handoff and each target's "
"execution evidence remain separate checks. Join publishers and observers "
"before reclaiming their storage; an empty queue or a stopped transfer alone "
"is not publisher join."
msgstr ""
"owner binding 必须证明端点实际 provider 控制器与所选增强控制器一致。仅匹配通用 sequence "
"方法表及逻辑父指针并不充分。Native 字模型提供独立 backend 并核对其实际模型控制器身份；它建模 8/16 位字、固定单元、所选 "
"CS、故障和保留排空，而不是转发到字节 SPI 实现。模型控制器身份是软件身份，不是观测到的硅片。各系列 hook、生成的 owner "
"binding、发布者交接和各目标执行证据仍需分别检查。回收存储前必须 join 发布者和观察者；队列为空或传输停止本身并不代表发布者已退出。"

msgid ""
"I2C hardware reload advances a long message without inserting another "
"address phase. STOP and successful bus-idle observation precede successful "
"return. On failure, the returned byte count records provider progress, "
"including writes handed to TXDR before their wire ACK is known. The count "
"does not authorize replay. Cancellation or failure does not justify "
"replaying an acknowledged prefix or silently performing bus recovery. The "
"enhanced face and base I2C interface share one executor. Timing inputs must "
"include their reviewed clock and electrical bounds; a calculation is not a "
"measurement of rise time or clock stretching."
msgstr ""
"I2C 硬件 reload 推进同一长消息，不插入新的地址阶段。成功返回前必须完成 STOP 并观察总线空闲。失败时，返回的字节数记录 provider"
" 进度，其中可能包含已交给 TXDR、但尚不知道线上 ACK "
"结果的写入。该计数不能授权重放。取消或失败不允许重放已确认前缀，也不允许静默执行总线恢复。增强 face 与 base I2C "
"接口共用一个执行者。时序输入必须给出已审时钟和电气边界；计算结果不是上升时间或 clock stretching 的实测值。"

msgid ""
"ADC decoding reads only consumer-owned or acquired, producer-detached "
"storage. It handles one-to-four-byte integer samples without allocating, "
"retaining a pointer or performing calibrated voltage conversion. The "
"consumer must first join producer/DMA access. Declared regular/injected "
"groups and trigger identities describe an already supported mode; they do "
"not start conversion or turn a software observation into a sample-aperture "
"timestamp."
msgstr ""
"ADC 解码只读取消费者拥有或已经 "
"acquire、且生产者已脱离的存储。它处理一至四字节整数采样，不分配、不保留指针，也不进行校准电压换算。消费者必须先 join 生产者/DMA "
"访问。声明的 regular/injected group 与 trigger "
"身份描述已受支持的模式，不会启动转换，也不会将软件观测变成采样孔径时间戳。"

msgid ""
"PWM group commit stages one coherent shadow batch; `SUCCESS` does not prove "
"the timer already applied it. A partial hardware-write failure must withdraw"
" output and retain fault responsibility. Clearing a break does not enable "
"output. The limited G474 register implementation does not supply PCB pin "
"selection, analog threshold measurements, a power stage or a synchronized "
"ADC provider. A selected software reference now generates exclusive "
"TIM1/COMP1 construction, fixed PA8/PA9/PA10 PWM pads and PA1/PA4 comparator "
"pads. Its cold lifecycle owns the selected clock/reset, safe levels, "
"comparator setup and settling, shared break vector and reverse cleanup. "
"Partial cleanup failure retains responsibility. These source facts establish"
" neither a fitted PCB route nor analog accuracy."
msgstr ""
"PWM group commit 暂存一个完整 shadow 批次；`SUCCESS` "
"不证明定时器已经应用它。部分硬件写入失败必须撤回输出并保留故障责任。清除 break 不会使能输出。有限的 G474 寄存器实现不提供 PCB "
"引脚选择、模拟阈值测量、功率级或同步 ADC provider。一个选定的软件参考现在生成独占 TIM1/COMP1 装配、固定 "
"PA8/PA9/PA10 PWM 焊盘与 PA1/PA4 比较器焊盘。其冷生命周期负责所选时钟与复位、安全电平、比较器配置和稳定等待、共享 break "
"向量及逆序清理。部分清理失败保留责任。这些源事实不证明 PCB 已装配该路线或模拟精度。"

msgid ""
"Separate concrete G474 providers implement TIM5 CH1 capture on PA0 and TIM3 "
"two-input quadrature counting on PA6/PA7. Capture publishes raw 32-bit "
"counter facts and explicit overcapture/loss under its bounded ring contract."
" Encoder reports a raw 16-bit count; it does not extend wrap, supply an "
"index input or estimate speed. Separate [capture](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/g474_control_assembly/timer-capture.toml) and "
"[encoder](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/g474_control_assembly/encoder.toml) software "
"references now generate their own static faces, typed getters and cold "
"pin/clock/vector lifecycle with whole-timer ownership and source/vector "
"drain. Startup starts neither a capture session nor encoder counting. The "
"application supplies the capture ring and explicitly starts and stops each "
"session. Failed source/vector or storage drain retains cleanup "
"responsibility. These exact selections do not inherit PWM-group "
"capabilities, synchronize ADC apertures or establish external wiring. "
"Product control and recovery policies remain external."
msgstr ""
"独立的具体 G474 provider 实现 PA0 上的 TIM5 CH1 捕获，以及 PA6/PA7 上的 TIM3 双输入正交计数。捕获按照有界 "
"ring 合同发布原始 32 位计数器事实，并明确报告 overcapture 和 loss。编码器报告原始 16 位计数，不扩展回绕、不提供 "
"index 输入，也不估算速度。独立的[捕获](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/g474_control_assembly/timer-"
"capture.toml)与[编码器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/g474_control_assembly/encoder.toml)软件参考现在分别生成静态 "
"face、typed getter 及冷引脚/时钟/向量生命周期，保持整定时器所有权与 source/vector "
"排空责任。平台启动既不启动捕获会话，也不启动编码器计数。应用提供捕获 ring，并显式启动和停止各会话。source/vector "
"或存储排空失败保留清理责任。这些精确选择不继承 PWM-group 能力，不同步 ADC 采样孔径，也不建立外部接线。产品控制与恢复策略保持外置。"

msgid "Preserve a single owner for H743 Flash timing"
msgstr "保持 H743 Flash 时序的唯一所有者"

msgid ""
"The selected fixed-HSI32/64 Flash path checks actual clock, requested and "
"observed voltage scale, Cache state and Flash programming-delay fields "
"before a program or erase pulse. Read latency alone does not satisfy the "
"programming contract. An optional cold timing owner changes the reviewed "
"Flash field only with both banks idle, verifies readback and retains its "
"saved state until reverse cleanup has safely restored it. The generated "
"Flash assembly selects this owner; a build without Flash does not acquire "
"it. Product erase regions and recovery policy remain outside this "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"所选固定 HSI32/64 Flash 路径在编程或擦除脉冲前检查实际时钟、请求和观测到的电压等级、Cache 状态以及 Flash "
"编程延迟字段。读取等待周期本身不满足编程合同。可选的冷时序所有者仅在两个 bank 都空闲时修改已审 Flash "
"字段，验证读回，并保留已保存状态，直到逆序清理安全恢复它。生成的 Flash 装配选择这一所有者；不含 Flash "
"的构建不会取得它。产品擦除区域与恢复策略仍不属于本仓库。"

msgid ""
"This is a bounded programming-timing correction for the selected existing "
"clock profiles. It does not enable a new high-speed clock, change option "
"bytes, qualify all silicon revisions or establish physical Flash endurance. "
"A proposed 384 MHz profile remains separate until its complete "
"CPU/bus/kernel-clock, voltage, Flash, peripheral and lifecycle contracts "
"have been implemented and verified."
msgstr ""
"这是针对所选既有时钟 profile 的有限编程时序修正。它不使能新的高速时钟、不修改 option bytes、不为所有硅片修订建立资格，也不建立实板"
" Flash 耐久性。提议中的 384 MHz profile 仍是独立工作，直到完整的 CPU、总线、kernel "
"clock、电压、Flash、外设及生命周期合同均已实现并验证。"

msgid "Observe time without inventing timing guarantees"
msgstr "观测时间，不虚构时序保证"

msgid ""
"[Timestamp facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h) distinguish hardware"
" events, IRQ observations, service observations and acquire observations. A "
"caller supplies extended ticks, a domain, an epoch, an exact stated tick "
"rate and explicit uncertainty knowledge. The domain owner extends counter "
"wrap and changes epoch after discontinuity, reset or rate change."
msgstr ""
"[时间戳事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/observation.h)区分硬件事件、IRQ 观测、service 观测与 acquire "
"观测。调用者提供扩展 ticks、domain、epoch、准确声明的 tick rate，以及显式的不确定度已知状态。Domain 所有者扩展计数器 "
"wrap，并在不连续、复位或变频后改变 epoch。"

msgid ""
"Elapsed-time comparison requires matching domain, epoch and rate, ordered "
"ticks and a representable uncertainty bound. It does not synchronize clocks,"
" convert time domains, access a hardware clock or prove that two facts refer"
" to causally paired events. Unknown uncertainty is different from a known "
"zero bound."
msgstr ""
"时间差比较要求 domain、epoch 与 rate 一致，ticks "
"有序且不确定度边界可表示。它不做时钟同步、跨域换算或硬件时钟访问，也不证明两条事实具有因果配对关系。未知不确定度不同于已知为零的边界。"

msgid ""
"Checked UART/SPI/I2C service reports an invalid face or an absent service "
"method. `SUCCESS` establishes one dispatch only. It does not establish "
"progress, health, SETTLED, wire completion or permission to reclaim storage."
" The ordinary service context, serialization and lifetime rules still apply,"
" with no hidden worker."
msgstr ""
"Checked UART/SPI/I2C service 可以报告非法 face 或缺少 service 方法。`SUCCESS` "
"只说明完成一次派发，不证明有进展、健康、SETTLED、线上完成或可以回收存储。普通 service 的上下文、串行化和生命周期规则仍适用，没有隐藏 "
"worker。"

msgid ""
"The optional [raw cycle probe](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/cycle_probe.h)"
" brackets one selected vector or one explicit typed service call with real "
"Arch counter snapshots. The initial generated path accepts `probe = true` "
"inside `[uart.NAME.irq]` only for a reviewed F407/F470 IRQ-word UART "
"selection. It adds one sidecar per physical vector and a pure typed getter "
"for that sidecar. Unselected macros evaluate no arguments, create no sidecar"
" and add no provider state or operations-table fields. The optional library "
"is linked only when selected; linked ELF checks establish the actual default"
" and selected cost."
msgstr ""
"可选的[原始周期探针](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/io/include/nexus/io/cycle_probe.h)使用真实 Arch 计数器快照，包围一个所选向量或一次显式 typed"
" service 调用。首条生成路径只在已审 F407/F470 IRQ-word UART 选择的 `[uart.NAME.irq]` 中接受 "
"`probe = true`。它为每个物理向量增加一个 sidecar，以及该 sidecar 的纯 typed "
"getter。未选宏不求值任何参数、不创建 sidecar，也不增加 provider 状态或方法表字段。只有显式选择才链接可选库；链接 ELF "
"检查确定默认及选配的实际成本。"

msgid ""
"A readable counter pair is a raw modulo-2^32 difference, including probe "
"cost and preemption. Multiple wraps, reset and clock-epoch continuity are "
"unknown; `elapsed_known` is always false. The probe neither enables nor "
"resets DWT. Unavailable samples and same-sidecar reentry are counted, and "
"diagnostic totals saturate instead of wrapping. Different nested vectors "
"require distinct sidecars. This is neither elapsed-time validation nor IRQ "
"arrival latency, exclusive execution time or a passed budget."
msgstr ""
"一对可读计数器值给出原始模 2^32 差值，包含探针成本和抢占。多次回绕、复位以及时钟 epoch 连续性都未知；`elapsed_known` 始终为"
" false。探针既不使能也不复位 DWT。不可用样本和同一 sidecar 重入被计数，诊断总数饱和而不回绕。不同嵌套向量需要不同 "
"sidecar。这既不是经过时间验证，也不是 IRQ 到达延迟、独占执行时间或预算通过结论。"

msgid ""
"Privileged Task snapshot saves and restores the incoming local interrupt "
"mask for a bounded statistics copy. A task producer must use that same "
"executor or be joined before reading; masking local IRQs does not join "
"another preempted Task, core or security state. Reclaim joins all tokens, "
"producers and readers. Typed UART-word and segmented-SPI service wrappers "
"dispatch the original service once even when observation is unavailable. "
"Observation failure never stops drain or releases a QUARANTINED borrow. "
"Consumers must prove private state and borrowed storage disjoint from the "
"optional observer. Raw probe samples cannot be promoted to validated timing "
"budgets without independent continuity proof."
msgstr ""
"特权 Task 快照保存并恢复进入时的本地中断屏蔽状态，仅在有界统计复制期间屏蔽中断。任务 producer 必须使用同一执行器，或在读取前退出并完成 "
"join；屏蔽本地 IRQ 不会 join 另一个被抢占的 Task、其他核或安全状态。回收前需 join 所有 token、producer 和 "
"reader。typed UART-word 和分段 SPI service 包装即使观测不可用，也只派发一次原 "
"service。观测失败不会停止排空或释放 QUARANTINED 借用。consumer 必须证明私有状态及被借用存储与可选 observer "
"不重叠。缺少独立连续性证明时，不得将原始探针样本提升为已验证时序预算。"

msgid "Prepare exact HIL protocols without promoting software facts"
msgstr "准备精确 HIL 协议，不将软件事实提升为资格"

msgid ""
"The existing [HIL workload planner](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/workloads.py) now "
"contains four additional exact protocols. Selection inspects resolved "
"controller and endpoint facts; a chip's advertised peripherals do not select"
" a workload."
msgstr ""
"既有 [HIL workload 规划器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/hil/workloads.py)现在增加四种精确协议。选择检查 resolved "
"控制器与端点事实；芯片宣传的外设能力不会自动选中 workload。"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "Required selected mechanism"
